WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.820
Should I decorate Lady Oscar's
room with these crimson roses?

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.210
Or perhaps these pure white roses?

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.660
They say a girl who pricks herself...

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:36.000
...with a thorn while picking roses,
isn't a noblewoman, but...

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.470
<i>''Mom''...?</i>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.640
<i>You call her Mom?!</i>

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.070
<i>What a vulgar form of address!</i>

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.810
<i>You're not a noblewoman, are you?!</i>

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:47.000
<i>You're not a noblewoman, are you?!</i>

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.580
Mom, I...

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:51.670
<i>What am I supposed to do?!</i>

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:55.680
<i>Mom!</i>

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.070
<i>Mom!</i>

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:01.950
<i>Mom!</i>

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.090
<i>R-Rosalie...</i>

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:07.060
<i>You're the daughter of a noble...</i>

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>Y-Your mother's name is...</i>

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:13.100
<i>M-Martine Gabrielle...</i>

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:17.370
But...

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:19.740
No one would ever believe that a girl like me,

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.910
one who grew up in the slums,
is the daughter of a noble.

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:24.500
I... I feel so...

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:27.650
Oscar, are you sure you're going to be all right?

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:30.780
You chastised Madame Polignac
in front of Lady Antoinette.

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:35.520
I can't imagine that power hungry woman
backing away and staying quiet for long.

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:37.030
There's nothing I can do now.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:40.260
Until Rosalie finds her mother's killer at court,

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:44.220
we have to steadfastly insist she's a noble.

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:46.330
<i>Lady Oscar...</i>

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:48.380
<i>She's doing it all for my sake...!</i>

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:51.540
Keep your guard up around Madame Polignac.

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:53.590
Who knows what that woman
will do to get back at you.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.510
I'm well aware of that.

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:58.180
<i>That country girl whom Oscar brought with her,</i>

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:01.010
<i>the next time she shows up at court,
I'll expose her true identity!</i>

