00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:42.200
episode

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:42.200
"Now,

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:42.200
the Moment of Encounter"

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.410
And so, in the 15th century,

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:53.140
the Hundred Years' War finally ended
during Charles VII's reign...

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:56.010
Yes, I understand it well.

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:57.320
You've really worked hard.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:04:00.880
You're versed in history,
literature and etiquette now.

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.550
<i>She's become beautiful.</i>

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:09.560
<i>It's as though she were born a lady.</i>

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:13.330
<i>At times, she displays such refined
elegance in her manners, as well.</i>

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:16.100
<i>It's hard to believe she's just an ordinary
girl who was born in the slums.</i>

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:21.440
Um...

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:22.200
Lady Oscar...

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:27.880
Do you know a noblewoman
named Martine Gabrielle?

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:30.180
Martine Gabrielle?

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:31.840
What's her family name?

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:34.210
I'm afraid...

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.450
I don't know...

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.790
I have no idea.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:38.130
Rosalie?

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:40.920
But she's my real mother!

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:42.720
What did you just say?!

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:46.330
She's the woman who gave birth to me!

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:49.730
That's what my mother told me
moments before she died.

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:51.430
She said I was the daughter of a noble.

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:53.940
Is that really true?

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:55.390
Why didn't you tell me until now?

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:58.610
It's because I couldn't believe it myself.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.580
How could I be the daughter of a noble...?

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:02.860
But if she's alive...

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:04.750
I want to meet her.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.040
I want to see her just once...

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:09.650
I see, Rosalie.

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:10.460
I understand.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:14.460
I'll do everything I can to find this noblewoman,
named Martine Gabrielle.

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:16.920
Yes, thank you very much!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:18.600
Now, sit down.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.470
Let's practice your pronunciation next.

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:23.880
Now that we know you're the daughter of
a noble, you can proudly appear at court.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:24.960
Yes.

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:31.190
Actually, Rosalie, Her Majesty has
said she would like to you see you.

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:32.970
Her Majesty has...?!

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:34.850
No...

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:36.640
I don't want to see the Queen.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.400
What's the matter, Rosalie?

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:40.780
No...

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.520
<i>Everyone used to say,</i>

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:49.160
<i>the reason why we suffer and
have barely enough to eat,</i>

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.920
<i>is all because of the Queen's wasteful
and extravagant spending.</i>

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:03.510
What are you so afraid of?

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:04.710
Is it something to do with Her Majesty?

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:06.590
No...

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:09.610
Rosalie.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:11.010
Let's practice your pronunciation.

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:12.050
Yes...

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:13.780
Unless you appear at court,

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:17.270
you'll never find your mother's
killer or your real mother.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:20.240
I'm sorry for being so selfish...

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:23.190
All right, we'll go to Versailles tomorrow.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:49.690
Come, Charlotte.

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:52.090
You're the belle of the ball tonight.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:56.270
The other ladies can't hold
a candle to your beauty.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:00.070
I hear that girl is coming with
Lady Oscar again tonight.

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:04.020
Mother, I'm certain that girl isn't a noble!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.140
Why are you so bothered by her?

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:09.490
There's no need for you to
worry about that country girl.

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:13.910
Come, let's go.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.690
My, Lady Charlotte is dressed splendidly
and looks quite beautiful today.

00:07:25.690 --> 00:07:26.960
Yes, indeed.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:31.560
Madame Polignac is showing off Lady Charlotte
to catch the eye of some rich noble.

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:35.130
But Lady Charlotte is only 11 years old.

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:38.300
Still, I wouldn't put it past Madame Polignac.

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:44.900
Presenting Colonel Oscar François de Jarjayes!

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:02.060
Oh, look!

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:05.130
It's as though everything is sparkling like
a painting, just around Lady Oscar.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:08.430
Yes, they're such beautiful people, aren't they?

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:12.200
Lady Oscar is always so dashing.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.010
Also, that young lady...

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.470
She's become so beautiful,
I almost didn't recognize her.

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:30.140
Mother!

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:33.120
No one is paying attention to me!

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:36.460
That girl was nothing but a country
bumpkin the last time I saw her...

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:39.300
There's nothing to worry about.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:43.200
That country girl will be knocked
off her perch soon enough.

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:44.290
Just wait and see.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:50.240
Presenting His Majesty the King and his Queen!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.160
Good evening, Oscar.

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:08.530
This must be the young lady we spoke about?

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:10.700
Yes, Lady Antoinette.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:12.360
As I mentioned to you the other day,

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:15.820
this is my distant relative,
Lady Rosalie Lamorlière{Moliàre}.

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:17.840
Mother!

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:20.640
Her Majesty addressed them before us!

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:23.290
This... This is unbelievable! Lady Antoinette!

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:32.170
Lady Rosalie Lamorlière{Moliàre}, please enjoy yourself.

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:35.120
<i>She's... the Queen?!</i>

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:36.990
<i>No...!</i>

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:39.140
<i>She's nothing like I had imagined!</i>

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:41.960
<i>She's nothing like how the
townspeople describe her!</i>

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:47.100
<i>She's as beautiful as a goddess and
seems so kind like Mother Mary.</i>

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:48.770
What's the matter, Rosalie?

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.060
Return her greeting.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:52.000
Uh, um...

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:55.860
It's an honor to meet you.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.410
Your Majesty.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:02.240
Perhaps you have forgotten about us?

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:04.580
Oh, Madame Polignac.

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:08.440
Your Majesty. My daughter, Charlotte,
would like to introduce herself.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.260
Come, Charlotte.

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:12.350
Introduce yourself.

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:22.680
<i>It's her...</i>

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:24.260
<i>It's her!</i>

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:33.130
<i>She's the woman who ran over my mother
with her carriage and rode away laughing!</i>

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:37.680
<i>What are you doing?!</i>

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:39.070
<i>Hurry up and move the carriage!</i>

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:47.830
<i>It's that filthy girl from the slums!</i>

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.760
<i>H-How could this be?!</i>

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.130
<i>Mom's killer!</i>

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:03.970
Wait, Rosalie...!

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:06.070
Lady Oscar!

00:11:07.010 --> 00:11:08.110
Why?!

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:09.100
Please let me go!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:31.790
Why?!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:32.670
Please let me go!

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.030
Dart out now and then what?!

00:11:35.030 --> 00:11:36.130
Do you want to die in vain?!

00:11:41.870 --> 00:11:44.630
<i>Th-This girl... Was she trying to...?!</i>

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:47.430
L-Lady Antoinette!

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:52.600
That girl named Rosalie isn't a noble!

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:56.980
What?

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:57.990
Not a noble?

00:11:57.990 --> 00:11:59.490
What does she mean?!

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:02.060
When I was in Paris, she...

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:03.200
Wait, Madame Polignac.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:06.660
What exactly happened in Paris?

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:16.550
You killed her innocent mother under
the wheels of your carriage in Paris.

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:20.510
Do you mean to confess that here,
in front of Her Majesty's presence?!

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:21.840
If you do,

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:25.510
remember that you will be confessing
before all of the nobles at court.

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:27.470
Even a woman of your influence,

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:29.910
will not be able to escape just punishment.

00:12:34.860 --> 00:12:36.490
Remember this!

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:38.190
She has come all this way,

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:41.360
for the sole purpose of finding
you and avenging her mother!

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:43.820
She is prepared to die for her cause!

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:45.570
Prepared to die...?!

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:55.420
Lady Antoinette.

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:58.580
I'm sorry for making such a fuss.

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.880
I had mistaken her for someone else.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:05.050
I figured so, Madame Polignac.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:08.350
Her being a girl from the slums
in Versailles is just silly.

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:10.410
Please forgive me.

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:20.830
<i>She came all this way, solely to avenge
her mother and is prepared to die...?</i>

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:22.230
<i>She can't mean it...</i>

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:25.070
<i>But if it's true, what a terrifying girl...!</i>

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:26.470
<i>How terrifying!</i>

00:13:33.610 --> 00:13:34.910
I was so close...

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:37.980
I was so close to avenging my mother...!

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:41.510
Just what was all that sword training for?!

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:43.360
Why?!

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:44.590
Why did you stop me?!

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:52.970
You take your revenge... and then what?

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:54.500
I don't care!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.940
I just want revenge!

00:13:56.380 --> 00:14:00.230
If you take your revenge, you'll be executed for certain, Rosalie.

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:01.400
Executed?

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:03.740
Don't you feel empty?

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:09.580
Even if you kill Madame Polignac,
it won't bring your mother back.

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:11.420
Do you understand, Rosalie?

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:16.500
Why don't you value your life more?

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.560
Don't die, Rosalie.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:23.060
You're already a member of the Jarjayes family.

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:24.420
I don't want you to die!

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:26.890
Lady Oscar...

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:29.500
Lady Oscar!

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:31.570
There, there. Don't cry anymore.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:35.100
No matter what it takes,
I promise we'll find your birth mother.

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:38.810
All right, Rosalie?

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:41.780
Live your life to the fullest
and think only about tomorrow.

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:43.230
Yes.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.610
Whoa...

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.410
Well, that's all of them.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.950
Good, let's split it up and look through them.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.860
Lady Oscar, what are they?

00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:59.410
It's the Registry of Nobles.

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:04.660
Martine, Martine...

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:06.830
Martine...

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:09.300
Martine László... wrong one...

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:14.030
Martine... Balmain... Legrand... Marchand...

00:15:45.140 --> 00:15:47.220
It's already morning, huh?

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:49.340
We're almost done.

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.170
Let's keep at it.

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:52.810
Look at Rosalie.

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:54.310
Hey, Rosalie.

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:55.220
Wait.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.450
A lot happened yesterday, so she's tired.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:58.690
Let her sleep.

00:15:59.090 --> 00:15:59.810
Yeah.

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:04.790
By the way, Oscar, this might
not be the complete registry.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.650
If we can't find her in here, then what?

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:13.070
I'll ask Madame Noailles when
I go to Versailles today.

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:17.250
She's the most knowledgeable person in France,
concerning the female nobility.

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:19.140
She might know.

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:19.760
Yeah.

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:31.260
Oscar, I'm afraid not.

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:36.210
Madame Noailles' grandmother's
illness had suddenly worsened,

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:38.720
so she returned to her estate
in Bordeaux late last night.

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:42.000
In that case, I'll wait for her return.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:42.940
Please excuse me.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.220
Oscar!

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:16.090
Oscar!

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:30.380
What was that noise just now?!

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:30.680
What happened?!

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:31.840
What's going on?!

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:38.280
How could this have happened?!

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:47.790
Are you all right?

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:49.250
I'm all right.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.300
That heavy chandelier...

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:54.470
How could this have happened?

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:57.220
It shouldn't be that old...

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:00.470
Are you all right, Oscar?

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:01.260
Yeah.

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:02.880
Still...

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:09.240
Oscar!

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:11.410
Oscar!

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:14.050
Oh, Oscar...

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:15.460
How terrifying...!

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:17.720
It's all right, Your Majesty.

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:21.330
See? Lady Oscar wasn't hurt.

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:30.840
<i>Was it a coincidence?</i>

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:32.630
<i>No, perhaps...</i>

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.800
<i>It's not unthinkable.</i>

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:47.450
<i>Late that evening, an urgent messenger
\hhad arrived for Oscar, sent by the Queen.</i>

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:51.400
At such a late hour, I wonder
what it could be about?

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:53.460
All right, tell them I'll come immediately.

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:55.020
Yes, certainly.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:00.360
Lady Oscar.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.100
Please don't go.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:04.080
You promised you'd check my grammar.

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:05.540
Rosalie.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.540
I would have liked to, but duty calls.

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:10.910
No, my promise came first!

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:12.500
I studied hard and prepared for our lesson!

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:15.880
Don't you understand?

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.460
The Queen has summoned me.

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:21.290
No! All you ever talk about is the Queen!

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:22.390
Rosalie!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:27.160
I'm sorry...

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:29.560
I didn't mean to... be so selfish...

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.520
But... But please let me accompany you.

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:34.630
All right, you have to hurry though.

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:05.820
<i>She doesn't understand.</i>

00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:09.160
<i>The Queen has everything...</i>

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:13.470
<i>But all I have are my feelings for Lady Oscar.</i>

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:36.210
André, this doesn't look
like the road to Versailles.

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.530
Don't worry.

00:20:37.530 --> 00:20:40.160
It's an urgent matter, so I'm sure
we're just taking a shortcut.

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:53.310
Watch out!

00:20:58.550 --> 00:20:59.980
André, be careful!

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:01.150
I know!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:06.360
Who are you?!

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:09.460
Is this a deliberate ambush on
Oscar François de Jarjayes?!

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:10.240
State your name!

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:11.760
No matter. Kill her!

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:37.230
Good, the girl came along!

00:21:38.890 --> 00:21:39.690
Rosalie!

00:21:40.010 --> 00:21:41.010
Help me!

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:53.080
Are you all right, Rosalie?!

00:21:59.010 --> 00:22:00.040
Oscar!

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:01.570
Oscar!

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:11.100
Die!

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:20.030
Oscar!

00:22:20.260 --> 00:22:21.610
Oscar!!

